### 6. Do Not Use / Do Not Infer List

| Field | Reason | Status |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Medical Allergies** | Severe clinical risk (e.g., Peanut anaphylaxis). An AI model guessing allergies from a user avoiding a dish can be fatal. | `DO_NOT_INFER` |
| **Religious Restrictions** | High cultural sensitivity (e.g., Halal, Kosher, Jain roots). Misclassifying meat types can cause severe user churn and offense. | `DO_NOT_INFER` |
| **Chronic Conditions** | Celiac, Chronic Kidney Disease (CKD). Requires clinician input, not AI guesswork. | `DO_NOT_INFER` |

